oko and she is 218 cm tall.\n\nShe is a very kind person, but she is a bit of a glutton and somewhat dumb.\n\nHere are some adventures she’s been on:\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Taro05707177/works/34\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Taro05707177/works/36\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Taro05707177/works/37\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Taro05707177/works/42\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Taro05707177/works/46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saigokudou/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a40aa20/uploads/origins/e980d18f-46c4-4157-8acc-ee5a4807da48?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bfece9ef29f6ac97fce2b8e19bea15f0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a40aa20/uploads/origins/e980d18f-46c4-4157-8acc-ee5a4807da48?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bfece9ef29f6ac97fce2b8e19bea15f0, https://si.imgix.net/5a40aa20/uploads/origins/e980d18f-46c4-4157-8acc-ee5a4807da48?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2f176866a399a15962476d77471ca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a40aa20/uploads/origins/e980d18f-46c4-4157-8acc-ee5a4807da48?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4524a974513ad75fc4ecce7308a95183 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Artwork or comic featuring my OC's. You can create your own story once again or use my suggestion.\n\nHomami: https://imgur.com/a/PpnjmaD\n\nSayoko: https://imgur.com/a/Q8Lq0CS\n\nMadokyu: https://imgur.com/a/GF8lvw8\n\nMadoka discovers a new form in Madokyu. She learns she has the power to grant others' wishes. Sayoko decides to test this by wishing for Homami's breasts to grow. At first Homami seems annoyed, but happily hugs Madoka between them.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saigokudou/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4dfc75/uploads/origins/9d2e68f0-0c5d-45ba-aa48-3ec3efc68e27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acd8d4b01f4341a78cdf096af9650a4d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4dfc75/uploads/origins/9d2e68f0-0c5d-45ba-aa48-3ec3efc68e27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acd8d4b01f4341a78cdf096af9650a4d, https://si.imgix.net/4d4dfc75/uploads/origins/9d2e68f0-0c5d-45ba-aa48-3ec3efc68e27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1cc4ecf060d1e37f62eb1cc83b82872 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d4dfc75/uploads/origins/9d2e68f0-0c5d-45ba-aa48-3ec3efc68e27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fc3f1a98aa2cd1a7f5f544c1ca1f22c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Artwork or comic featuring Madoka Kaname and my two OC’s Sayoko and Homami. You can come up with an idea yourself or use this one I have if you’d prefer that.\n\nHomami: https://imgur.com/a/1mrtEMB\n\nSayoko: https://imgur.com/a/L0IySMT\n\nA story of how Sayoko and Homami came to be. One day, Homura and Mami were arguing with each other, and Sayaka and Kyoko were arguing with each other.\n\nMadoka expresses a wish they would stop arguing and get closer to one another. However, unbeknowst to them, Kyubey was around and granted her off handed comment as a wish. Madoka’s friends are fused together, making Homami and Sayoko. I think they would still be wearing the Mitakihara School Uniform, but it would be too small for their now larger bodies, especially on Homami.\n\nMadoka cannot even rejoice that her friends have stopped arguing, because Homami and Sayoko get into a fight about who was responsible for letting Madoka become a Magical Girl.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saigokudou/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1bccf32030dfdb9a6df853290859c62", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb